cff-version: 1.2.0
title: OpenPACE
abstract: >-
  Hardware designs and software for OpenPACE, a compact, fully integrated
  system for phage-assisted continuous evolution (PACE). Includes 3D-printable
  files and PCB manufacturing files for the EvoFlow reactor and the EvoSampler,
  together with the Evotool, EvoMonitor and EvoGenotype software.
type: software
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  protocol paper listed under preferred-citation.
